# Per-submission scratch for the Pareto grid. batch/pareto_runs.txt and
# batch/runs.txt ARE tracked -- they are generated from the study manifest and
# every stage reads them. The files below are throwaway subsets made on lxplus
# with head/grep/sed for a smoke test or a partial resubmission. Tracking them
# makes `git pull` on the cluster abort with "untracked working tree files
# would be overwritten by merge", which is exactly how a fix sat undeployed
# through two full 45-minute runs (2026-09-19).
batch/pareto_runs_smoke.txt
batch/pareto_runs_rest.txt
batch/pareto_runs_seed*.txt
batch/runae_pareto_smoke.sub
batch/runae_pareto_rest.sub
batch/runae_pareto_debug.sub
batch/runae_pareto_seed*.sub
